{
  "schema_version": "1.0.0",
  "edition_id": "WEBSTER1833",
  "book_code": "JOB",
  "chapter": 17,
  "verses": [
    {
      "id": "JOB.17.1",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JOB.17.1",
      "verse": 1,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "My breath is corrupt, my days are extinct, the graves ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "are ready",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " for me.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.17.2",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JOB.17.2",
      "verse": 2,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Are there",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " not mockers with me? and doth not my eye continue in their provocation?",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.17.3",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JOB.17.3",
      "verse": 3,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Lay down now, put me in a surety with thee; who ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " he ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "that",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " will strike hands with me?",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.17.4",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JOB.17.4",
      "verse": 4,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For thou hast hid their heart from understanding: therefore shalt thou not exalt ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "them",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.17.5",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JOB.17.5",
      "verse": 5,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "He that speaketh flattery to ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "his",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " friends, even the eyes of his children shall fail.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.17.6",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JOB.17.6",
      "verse": 6,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "He hath made me also a by-word of the people; and in former time I was as a tabret.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.17.7",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JOB.17.7",
      "verse": 7,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "My eye also is dim by reason of sorrow, and all my members ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "are",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " as a shade.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.17.8",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JOB.17.8",
      "verse": 8,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Upright ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "men",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " shall be astonished at this, and the innocent shall stir up himself against the hypocrite.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.17.9",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JOB.17.9",
      "verse": 9,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The righteous also shall hold on his way, and he that hath clean hands shall be stronger and stronger.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.17.10",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JOB.17.10",
      "verse": 10,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "But as for you all, do ye return, and come now: for I cannot find ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "one",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " wise ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "man",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " among you.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.17.11",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JOB.17.11",
      "verse": 11,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "My days are past, my purposes are broken off, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "even",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the thoughts of my heart.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.17.12",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JOB.17.12",
      "verse": 12,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "They change the night into day: the light ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " short because of darkness.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.17.13",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JOB.17.13",
      "verse": 13,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "If I wait, the grave ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " my house: I have made my bed in the darkness.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.17.14",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JOB.17.14",
      "verse": 14,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "I have said to corruption, Thou ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "art",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " my father: to the worm, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "Thou art",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " my mother, and my sister.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.17.15",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JOB.17.15",
      "verse": 15,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And where ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " now my hope? as for my hope, who will see it?",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.17.16",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JOB.17.16",
      "verse": 16,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "They shall go down to the bars of the pit, when ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "our",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " rest together ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " in the dust.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    }
  ]
}
